		{
			dependencies: ["2B10426B62B49B13"]
			description: ["Ships are separated by temperatures. While you could use the same boat everywhere, sailing in the appropriate biomes give a 10% speed boost in the right waters and a 10% speed &odecreease&r in the wrong waters."]
