		{
			dependencies: ["15ACD993630984F4"]
			description: [
				"Small Ships adds 4 different boats to the game for various purposes, but above all, transportation. To get started, you'll want three boats of the appropriate wood type. Some boats require chests as well."
				"Your ships will be able to hold some cargo, but putting too much in it could reduce its overall speed by up to 10%. To access the cargo from outside the ship, use it while crouching."
				"I don't want to overwhelm you, so I'll finish with telling you that a damaged hull can be repaired with wooden planks and iron nuggets."
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			id: "2B10426B62B49B13"
