		{
			dependencies: ["2B10426B62B49B13"]
			description: [
				"The oceans aren't exactly safe, and the last thing you want is to be left defenseless under attack. For this, I'd recommend adding a cannon or two. It's as simple as right clicking your ship with the cannon in hand. With that done and dusted, you simply need to add some cannon balls to your ship's cargo, then fire by pressing the keybind (Default Space) while looking in the cannon's direction."
				"Cannon's aren't light, though, and each one will lower your ship's speed by 2.5%. Fortunately, removal is as simple as hitting it with a pickaxe."
			]
			id: "0AB1E6FBCB9E81EC"
			rewards: [{
				amount: 100L
				currency: "eternalcurrencies:ancientcoins"
