		{
			dependencies: ["7DA024433105259D"]
			description: [
				"Rotorcraft such as the airship can hover in place and move much like a boat in many cases, using the left and right keys to turn around. Holding &o&6The Space Bar&r will lift you into the air, while holding shift lowers you. Unlike many vehicles and mounts, &o&6exiting the aircraft is done via a keybind (Default: R)&r."
				"The vehicles will require time to take off. You can view this via the meter above your hotbar."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "ftbquests:custom_icon"
				tag: {
					Icon: "alexscaves:item/game_controller"
				}
