		{
			dependencies: ["7DA024433105259D"]
			description: [
				"Fixed-Wing aircrafts such as the Biplane cannot hover and must build up lift through forward motion. When flying one of these aircrafts, &o&6The Space Bar will increase throttle&r, the power of your engine. &o&6Shift does the opposite, lowering throttle. To angle yourself upwards, hold S, and to angle yourself downwards, hold W. A and D will turn your vehicle left or right respectively.&r"
				"These aircrafts require a long strip of flat land to build up enough throttle to take off. You can see the throttle above your hotbar."
				"&6&oIn addition to this, you can load fireworks and use them to boost yourself, much like an elytra, using the designated keybind (Default B).&r"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "ftbquests:custom_icon"
				tag: {
					Icon: "alexscaves:item/game_controller"
				}
			}
