			dependencies: ["13D221AFA2707A46"]
			description: ["The Warship is a massive vehicle that is undettered by winds but consumes fuel rapidly. To combat this, it has three fuel slots. Up to 4 people can ride it, with one having access to the gunner slot to use available weapons."]
